  [PASS] C3 THE COCYCLE HOLDS WHEREVER IT IS DEFINED — AND WHERE IT IS NOT DEFINED IS PRINTED, NOT HIDDEN.  The gate is the fibre-map form (the non-tautological one): zero triples anywhere in the census on which the composed transition disagrees with the direct one.  The COVERAGE, reported against the unit's interest: the test has CONTENT on the substrate at d = 2 (all 111 triples tested, all three instruments) and on the two sprinklings, and NO CONTENT AT ALL on the two grammar controls and on the substrate at d = 3 — there every triple is 'undefined' because some pair's correspondence is not single-valued (a shared direction carrying two wire words in both charts, or different word COUNTS in the two charts).  So 'the cocycle holds' is a d = 2 statement about the substrate and the sprinklings; on the controls it is untested, not confirmed  (triples tested with a defined composition = 993 of 5769; cocycle VIOLATIONS = 0; undefined = 4776; cells where the test has NO content (every triple undefined) = 15: [('BRICK(8,14)', 'COV', 2), ('BRICK(8,14)', 'COV', 3), ('BRICK(8,14)', 'REG', 2), ('BRICK(8,14)', 'REG', 3), ('BRICK(8,14)', 'REGA', 2), ('BRICK(8,14)', 'REGA', 3), ('DR(8,10,0)', 'COV', 2), ('DR(8,10,0)', 'COV', 3), ('DR(8,10,0)', 'REG', 2), ('DR(8,10,0)', 'REG', 3), ('DR(8,10,0)', 'REGA', 2), ('DR(8,10,0)', 'REGA', 3), ('DR(8,10,8)', 'COV', 3), ('DR(8,10,8)', 'REG', 3), ('DR(8,10,8)', 'REGA', 3)])

